abstract: >
  pqc-audit-italia is an open-source scanner that identifies where
  an organization uses cryptography today, how exposed it is to HNDL
  (Harvest Now, Decrypt Later) and Q-Day, and how to plan migration
  toward NIST PQC standards (FIPS 203 / 204 / 205). It targets the
  Italian regulatory landscape (NIS2 D.Lgs. 138/2024, DORA Reg. (EU)
  2022/2554, AgID guidelines, Banca d'Italia circulars) with
  compliance-ready reports in Italian and English, plus four bundled
  policies (agid_2026, pa_critical_2027, banking_italy, nist_baseline).
